<h2>HTML Basics</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Role of HTML</strong>: HTML represents the content and structur=
e of the web page.</li>
<li><strong>HTML Elements</strong>: Elements are the building blocks for an=
 HTML document. They represent headings, paragraphs, links, images and more=
. Most HTML elements consist of an opening tag (<code>&lt;elementName&gt;</=
code>) and a closing tag (<code>&lt;/elementName&gt;</code>).</li>
</ul>
<p>Here is the basic syntax:</p>
<details class=3D"code-details" open=3D""><summary class=3D"code-details-su=
