&lt;</span>elementName</span><span class=3D"token punctuation">&gt;</span><=
/span>Content goes here<span class=3D"token tag"><span class=3D"token tag">=
<span class=3D"token punctuation">&lt;/</span>elementName</span><span class=
=3D"token punctuation">&gt;</span></span>
</code></pre></details>
<ul>
<li><strong>Void Elements</strong>: Void elements cannot have any content a=
nd only have a start tag. Examples include <code>img</code> and <code>meta<=
/code> elements.</li>
</ul>
