</code></pre></details>
<ul>
<li><strong>Attributes</strong>: An attribute is a value placed inside the =
opening tag of an HTML element. Attributes provide additional information a=
bout the element or specify how the element should behave. Here is the basi=
c syntax for an attribute:</li>
</ul>
